{"id":4905,"date":"2025-07-31T15:48:32","date_gmt":"2025-07-31T15:48:32","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4905"},"modified":"2025-08-28T09:24:05","modified_gmt":"2025-08-28T02:24:05","slug":"cach-tang-tim-tren-tiktok-hieu-qua","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-tiktok\/cach-tang-tim-tren-tiktok-hieu-qua\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch t\u0103ng tim tr\u00ean TikTok hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 an to\u00e0n, t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"LG9gdOcfloGROUxiGtRlDwbzgya\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HbaIdovxIo5jjfxOup1lQcfFgfg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u0103ng tim tr\u00ean TikTok hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi n\u1ed9i dung cu\u1ed1n h\u00fat, \u0111\u0103ng \u0111\u00fang th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m v\u00e0 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c th\u1eadt v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem. Thay v\u00ec ch\u1ea1y theo l\u01b0\u1ee3t tim \u1ea3o, h\u00e3y t\u1eadp trung x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng video ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng, b\u1eaft trend h\u1ee3p l\u00fd v\u00e0 ch\u0103m s\u00f3c h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o uy t\u00edn. C\u00f9ng <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\">Lemon Digital<\/span><\/strong><\/a> t\u1ed1i \u01b0u chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u1ed9i dung TikTok m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng v\u00e0 an to\u00e0n!<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WxHJdeGT8oazWkxYP4VlOsAYgTf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Q4ycd3zWMolwthxnLi7l3ZGWgtc\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1. C\u00e1ch t\u0103ng tim TikTok l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/strong><\/h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4906\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4906\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4906\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-5.png\" alt=\"T\u0103ng tim (l\u01b0\u1ee3t th\u00edch) tr\u00ean TikTok hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 an to\u00e0n, gi\u00fap video c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n thu h\u00fat \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nhi\u1ec1u ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem h\u01a1n v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t h\u01a1n tr\u00ean For You Page\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-5.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-5-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-5-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-5-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-5-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4906\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">T\u0103ng tim (l\u01b0\u1ee3t th\u00edch) tr\u00ean TikTok hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 an to\u00e0n, gi\u00fap video c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n thu h\u00fat \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nhi\u1ec1u ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem h\u01a1n v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t h\u01a1n tr\u00ean For You Page<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UygCdf2KoomeL5xrPkElMeeyg7c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#8220;Tim&#8221; tr\u00ean TikTok l\u00e0 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng h\u00ecnh tr\u00e1i tim m\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng nh\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec3 th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 y\u00eau th\u00edch \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t video. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u1ea5t, cho th\u1ea5y video c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 cao hay kh\u00f4ng. S\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng tim cao gi\u00fap t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 uy t\u00edn c\u1ee7a t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n, th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y TikTok ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i video \u0111\u1ebfn nhi\u1ec1u ng\u01b0\u1eddi h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KdYUdaweRoKzEYxHtRKlgo0lg5f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u0103ng tim tr\u00ean TikTok l\u00e0 qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh t\u1ed1i \u01b0u n\u1ed9i dung v\u00e0 chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u0103ng video \u0111\u1ec3 thu h\u00fat nhi\u1ec1u l\u01b0\u1ee3t y\u00eau th\u00edch t\u1eeb ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem. M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 c\u00e1ch ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn g\u1ed3m:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-KCH0dBZQhoD04Sxm5vql9Ci5gGE\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1.1. T\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn, b\u1eaft trend ho\u1eb7c h\u00e0i h\u01b0\u1edbc<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S2zDdGisloJBwvxPb5jlmaF6gyb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">L\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng tim tr\u00ean TikTok. Ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng th\u01b0\u1eddng b\u1ecb thu h\u00fat b\u1edfi nh\u1eefng video c\u00f3 m\u1edf \u0111\u1ea7u \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng, n\u1ed9i dung ng\u1eafn g\u1ecdn, d\u1ec5 hi\u1ec3u v\u00e0 mang l\u1ea1i c\u1ea3m x\u00fac \u2014 d\u00f9 l\u00e0 b\u1ea5t ng\u1edd, vui nh\u1ed9n hay \u0111\u1ed3ng c\u1ea3m. B\u1ea1n n\u00ean c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt c\u00e1c trend \u0111ang hot (nh\u1ea1c, th\u1eed th\u00e1ch, hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng) \u0111\u1ec3 n\u1ed9i dung d\u1ec5 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn h\u01a1n v\u1edbi c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng. Ngo\u00e0i ra, t\u00ednh h\u00e0i h\u01b0\u1edbc, s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o ho\u1eb7c mang y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 gi\u1ea3i tr\u00ed cao th\u01b0\u1eddng khi\u1ebfn ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng th\u1ea3 tim v\u00e0 chia s\u1ebb, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 gi\u00fap video lan t\u1ecfa nhanh ch\u00f3ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8CNdOXuVoApjqxXEEDlNgHngJf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-FAdjdmpzToOzwbxJRpzllLbDg8e\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1.2. D\u00f9ng hashtag th\u1ecbnh h\u00e0nh v\u00e0 li\u00ean quan<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IY6WdyBiuojpQRxQBFElRDTDgph\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">D\u00f9ng hashtag th\u1ecbnh h\u00e0nh v\u00e0 li\u00ean quan gi\u00fap video c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n d\u1ec5 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c TikTok ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111\u00fang \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng quan t\u00e2m. Hashtag \u0111\u00f3ng vai tr\u00f2 nh\u01b0 \u201ct\u1eeb kh\u00f3a\u201d gi\u00fap t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb trong trang \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t (For You) v\u00e0 k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm. B\u1ea1n n\u00ean k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa c\u00e1c hashtag \u0111ang hot nh\u01b0 #fyp, #xuhuong, #viral v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng hashtag c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 theo n\u1ed9i dung video nh\u01b0 #reviewdoan, #lamdep, #meovat, v.v. Vi\u1ec7c ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u00fang hashtag gi\u00fap video ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u00fang t\u1ec7p ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t tim, l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4908\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4908\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4908\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/4-3.png\" alt=\"S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng hashtag \u0111\u1ea9y video c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n l\u00ean xu h\u01b0\u1edbng\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/4-3.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/4-3-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/4-3-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/4-3-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/4-3-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4908\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng hashtag \u0111\u1ea9y video c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n l\u00ean xu h\u01b0\u1edbng<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"LG9gdOcfloGROUxiGtRlDwbzgya\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-FsMRdYnqroV7BfxsPUYlbwEegIe\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1.3. T\u1ed1i \u01b0u caption v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh b\u00eca video<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GN7Qd6A4boYH4bxhHwlldPHTgbg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 quan tr\u1ecdng gi\u00fap video thu h\u00fat s\u1ef1 ch\u00fa \u00fd ngay t\u1eeb c\u00e1i nh\u00ecn \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean. Caption n\u00ean ng\u1eafn g\u1ecdn, g\u1ee3i t\u00f2 m\u00f2 ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1eb7t c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi \u0111\u1ec3 k\u00edch th\u00edch ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem d\u1eebng l\u1ea1i t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c, v\u00ed d\u1ee5: \u201cB\u1ea1n c\u00f3 d\u00e1m th\u1eed kh\u00f4ng?\u201d ho\u1eb7c \u201cAi c\u0169ng m\u1eafc sai l\u1ea7m n\u00e0y!\u201d. \u0110\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi, h\u00ecnh b\u00eca (thumbnail) n\u00ean ch\u1ecdn khung h\u00ecnh r\u00f5 n\u00e9t, c\u00f3 bi\u1ec3u c\u1ea3m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt ho\u1eb7c ch\u00e8n ch\u1eef m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 ng\u1eafn (n\u1ebfu c\u1ea7n) \u0111\u1ec3 truy\u1ec1n t\u1ea3i n\u1ed9i dung ch\u00ednh m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch tr\u1ef1c quan. Khi caption h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh b\u00eca b\u1eaft m\u1eaft, ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u00f3 xu h\u01b0\u1edbng nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o xem v\u00e0 th\u1ea3 tim nhi\u1ec1u h\u01a1n, gi\u00fap video t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 lan t\u1ecfa.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-ImgDdytxkofhvFxqIr3l2Hweg2c\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1.4. \u0110\u0103ng v\u00e0o khung gi\u1edd v\u00e0ng\u00a0<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VJXod0tAno27Kcxz8W8ljKMJgIb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u0103ng video TikTok v\u00e0o khung gi\u1edd v\u00e0ng l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n nh\u01b0ng r\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t tim v\u00e0 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn nhi\u1ec1u ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng h\u01a1n. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 kho\u1ea3ng th\u1eddi gian ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem TikTok ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng \u0111\u00f4ng nh\u1ea5t \u2014 th\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e0o gi\u1edd ngh\u1ec9 tr\u01b0a v\u00e0 bu\u1ed5i t\u1ed1i sau khi tan l\u00e0m, tan h\u1ecdc. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n \u0111\u0103ng video trong khung gi\u1edd n\u00e0y, kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n tr\u00ean tab \u201cD\u00e0nh cho b\u1ea1n\u201d (For You Page) s\u1ebd cao h\u01a1n, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 gi\u00fap video nh\u1eadn nhi\u1ec1u l\u01b0\u1ee3t tim, b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn v\u00e0 chia s\u1ebb h\u01a1n. \u0110\u1ec3 t\u0103ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3, h\u00e3y k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p \u0111\u0103ng \u0111\u00fang gi\u1edd v\u1edbi n\u1ed9i dung ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u00e0 hashtag ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-AvyVdDNwAoGSYHx2yqMlmWVugxf\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1.5. T\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c l\u1ea1i v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng g\u1eafn k\u1ebft<\/strong><\/h3>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4909\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4909\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4909\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/5-2.png\" alt=\"\u0110\u1eebng b\u1ecf qua vi\u1ec7c tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi comment, ghim b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn hay k\u00eau g\u1ecdi ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem chia s\u1ebb \u00fd ki\u1ebfn\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/5-2.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/5-2-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/5-2-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/5-2-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/5-2-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4909\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">\u0110\u1eebng b\u1ecf qua vi\u1ec7c tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi comment, ghim b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn hay k\u00eau g\u1ecdi ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem chia s\u1ebb \u00fd ki\u1ebfn<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XkGQdO8jyoXtnrxSRrSlfk8fguf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c l\u1ea1i v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng g\u1eafn k\u1ebft l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng v\u00e0 t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t tim tr\u00ean TikTok. Khi b\u1ea1n tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn, th\u1ea3 tim ho\u1eb7c th\u1eadm ch\u00ed quay video ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i (video reply), ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem s\u1ebd c\u1ea3m th\u1ea5y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1eafng nghe v\u00e0 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y h\u1ecd quay l\u1ea1i k\u00eanh c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n nhi\u1ec1u h\u01a1n, t\u0103ng m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 trung th\u00e0nh v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng th\u1ea3 tim cho c\u00e1c video ti\u1ebfp theo. Thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n TikTok c\u0169ng \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 cao c\u00e1c t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u00f3 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c 2 chi\u1ec1u, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i video r\u1ed9ng h\u01a1n v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea9y m\u1ea1nh \u0111\u1ed9 lan t\u1ecfa t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean c\u1ee7a n\u1ed9i dung.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XR7AdBQOioDmhCxo8dll1UlJgng\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RPs0dXWwWoIcGhxuMc6l7C0sgRb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Vi\u1ec7c t\u0103ng tim kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 gi\u00fap video lan t\u1ecfa r\u1ed9ng r\u00e3i m\u00e0 c\u00f2n c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n \u0111\u00e1ng k\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 kinh doanh n\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n \u0111ang b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok Shop. N\u1ebfu c\u1ea7n h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 chuy\u00ean s\u00e2u h\u01a1n, Lemon Digital s\u1eb5n s\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng b\u1ea1n t\u1ed1i \u01b0u t\u1eebng chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u1ed9i dung v\u00e0 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QMIPdReEzoBjmtxcaSgl2komggg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-NbCEdDfCoodvPTxFCQ5lzyJUgJh\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>2. T\u1ea1i sao n\u00ean t\u0103ng tim tr\u00ean TikTok?<\/strong><\/h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4907\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4907\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4907\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-4.png\" alt=\"TikTok \u01b0u ti\u00ean hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb video c\u00f3 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c cao (tim, chia s\u1ebb, b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn) tr\u00ean m\u1ee5c For You Page\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-4.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-4-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-4-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-4-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-4-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4907\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">TikTok \u01b0u ti\u00ean hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb video c\u00f3 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c cao (tim, chia s\u1ebb, b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn) tr\u00ean m\u1ee5c For You Page<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KLhddcevEo2KahxgO3Sl7OJjg1b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u0103ng tim tr\u00ean TikTok kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 con s\u1ed1 hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb m\u00e0 c\u00f2n mang l\u1ea1i nhi\u1ec1u gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb thi\u1ebft th\u1ef1c, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t n\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n \u0111ang x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n, b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng, ho\u1eb7c ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n k\u00eanh n\u1ed9i dung l\u00e2u d\u00e0i.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Oh49dRZ8qoAlZWxnvpQlIzcTgRe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Video c\u00f3 nhi\u1ec1u l\u01b0\u1ee3t tim th\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n \u01b0u ti\u00ean ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i, d\u1ec5 xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n tr\u00ean trang &#8220;D\u00e0nh cho b\u1ea1n&#8221;, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn r\u1ed9ng h\u01a1n v\u00e0 thu h\u00fat th\u00eam ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i. \u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng ho\u1eb7c s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung, l\u01b0\u1ee3t tim cao gi\u00fap t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 tin c\u1eady, c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i v\u00e0 m\u1edf ra nhi\u1ec1u c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u1edbi nh\u00e3n h\u00e0ng. Ngo\u00e0i ra, \u0111\u00e2y c\u0169ng l\u00e0 ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 y\u00eau th\u00edch c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem, g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng trung th\u00e0nh v\u00e0 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XoRldOYv2o4KjWxJFoYlyCALg4e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-IEQTd3dmeox4WlxnoAflcUSIgvd\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>3. M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 m\u1eb9o t\u0103ng tim TikTok mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AjgCdCN6EotOpuxhuwBl6AV5gFd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>1. D\u00e0nh 3 gi\u00e2y \u0111\u1ea7u \u0111\u1ec3 g\u00e2y ch\u00fa \u00fd: <\/strong>H\u00e3y t\u1ea1o ph\u1ea7n m\u1edf \u0111\u1ea7u th\u1eadt \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng, b\u1ea5t ng\u1edd ho\u1eb7c t\u00f2 m\u00f2. Ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem s\u1ebd quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u00f3 ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c xem hay kh\u00f4ng trong v\u00e0i gi\u00e2y \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ItUBdzCSpoN69SxpWLZl6BD3gzg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>2. \u0110\u0103ng video \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u1eb7n v\u00e0 \u0111\u00fang khung gi\u1edd v\u00e0ng: <\/strong>N\u00ean \u0111\u0103ng v\u00e0o 11h\u201313h ho\u1eb7c 19h\u201321h \u2014 th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng TikTok ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng nhi\u1ec1u nh\u1ea5t, gi\u00fap video d\u1ec5 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KQ0ddT1Hdo0JscxQt84lIAUngRd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>3. T\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng trend, nh\u1ea1c hot v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng m\u1edbi: <\/strong>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u1ea1c, filter ho\u1eb7c th\u1eed th\u00e1ch \u0111ang th\u1ecbnh h\u00e0nh gi\u00fap video \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u01b0u ti\u00ean hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb v\u00e0 k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i v\u1edbi xu h\u01b0\u1edbng c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R9IZdFqFLoMu2CxRatllv5qGged\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>4. T\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c t\u00edch c\u1ef1c v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem: <\/strong>Tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn, th\u1ea3 tim l\u1ea1i ho\u1eb7c quay video ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng g\u1eafn k\u1ebft. TikTok \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 cao nh\u1eefng t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c 2 chi\u1ec1u.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T1gRdc9wfoTqtCxSTsOlkfJOg7f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>5. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng hashtag li\u00ean quan v\u00e0 \u0111ang hot: <\/strong>K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p hashtag ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn nh\u01b0 #fyp, #xuhuong v\u1edbi hashtag ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 gi\u00fap video ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u00fang t\u1ec7p ng\u01b0\u1eddi quan t\u00e2m.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EoY9dFZTNoIXFBx66GLl8y8igNc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>6. Ch\u00e8n caption k\u00edch th\u00edch h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng: <\/strong>Caption n\u00ean ng\u1eafn g\u1ecdn, k\u00e8m l\u1eddi k\u00eau g\u1ecdi nh\u01b0 \u201cB\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 th\u1eed ch\u01b0a?\u201d, &#8220;B\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn \u00fd ki\u1ebfn c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n nh\u00e9!&#8221;,&#8230; \u0111\u1ec3 khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HWAQd16zKo8uQvxk6R5li93zgsf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Nh\u1eefng m\u1eb9o n\u00e0y ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed, d\u1ec5 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n v\u00e0 n\u1ebfu \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u1eb7n, s\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n t\u0103ng tim m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 hay d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 b\u00ean ngo\u00e0i.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZJQodEzsNo07tKxc8DulZgU9gvb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4910\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4910\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4910\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-4-1.png\" alt=\"L\u01b0u \u00fd \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng tim TikTok mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-4-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-4-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-4-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-4-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-4-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4910\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">L\u01b0u \u00fd \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng tim TikTok mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-NbQUdRKHUoJNxaxjXJRlMbw5gyb\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>4. Ti\u00eau ch\u00ed ch\u1ecdn web t\u0103ng tim TikTok uy t\u00edn<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IXzvdygQDo5Rm5xN388lx5qvgqb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ec3 ch\u1ecdn m\u1ed9t website cung c\u1ea5p d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 t\u0103ng tim TikTok uy t\u00edn, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n xem x\u00e9t c\u00e1c ti\u00eau ch\u00ed sau \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o an to\u00e0n, hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 tr\u00e1nh r\u1ee7i ro vi ph\u1ea1m ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch TikTok.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D834dgzrzoaXdex4FI0lW3aPgLe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ec3 ch\u1ecdn m\u1ed9t website cung c\u1ea5p d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 t\u0103ng tim TikTok uy t\u00edn, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 k\u1ef9 l\u01b0\u1ee1ng d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean c\u00e1c ti\u00eau ch\u00ed sau \u0111\u00e2y \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o an to\u00e0n, hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 tr\u00e1nh r\u1ee7i ro vi ph\u1ea1m ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a TikTok. C\u00e1c ti\u00eau ch\u00ed n\u00e0y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ed5ng h\u1ee3p t\u1eeb c\u00e1c ngu\u1ed3n web \u0111\u00e1ng tin c\u1eady v\u00e0 kinh nghi\u1ec7m th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n \u0111\u01b0a ra l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn s\u00e1ng su\u1ed1t.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CsetdM2XNoW2qFxYD6glIUEvg9g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Uy t\u00edn v\u00e0 minh b\u1ea1ch:<\/strong> Ch\u1ecdn website c\u00f3 \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 t\u1ed1t, th\u00f4ng tin li\u00ean h\u1ec7 r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng v\u00e0 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng l\u00e2u n\u0103m nh\u01b0 Likeqq.vn, BeoBeo Marketing.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvzcdb6HvoD74PxnSxYloQa8gIe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Cam k\u1ebft tim th\u1eadt:<\/strong> \u01afu ti\u00ean d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 cam k\u1ebft t\u0103ng tim t\u1eeb ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng th\u1eadt, c\u00f3 b\u1ea3o h\u00e0nh n\u1ebfu b\u1ecb t\u1ee5t.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FUN3dOLHvoAlxPxSiHllxmFggvg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>An to\u00e0n b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt:<\/strong> Kh\u00f4ng cung c\u1ea5p m\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u, ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n link video; tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch TikTok.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Njuld9YiSocBgqx7t0Hlsi34gxc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Gi\u00e1 c\u1ea3 h\u1ee3p l\u00fd:<\/strong> B\u1ea3ng gi\u00e1 c\u00f4ng khai, kh\u00f4ng ph\u00ed \u1ea9n; tr\u00e1nh d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 qu\u00e1 r\u1ebb d\u00f9ng tim \u1ea3o k\u00e9m ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VdBLdbK7do5Gkaxx7zRlyTRdgBg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p:<\/strong> C\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 qua Zalo, hotline, x\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n nhanh ch\u00f3ng, minh b\u1ea1ch.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LFUUdH3GQo2whVx9ryUl2ZOogGe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 \u0111a d\u1ea1ng:<\/strong> C\u00f3 th\u00eam t\u0103ng follow, view, b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XMOkdkJcnoz3NLxhFR6l7vflgZf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Tr\u00e1nh l\u1eeba \u0111\u1ea3o:<\/strong> Kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0m nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ee5 ph\u1ee9c t\u1ea1p; \u01b0u ti\u00ean n\u01a1i c\u00f3 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n v\u00e0 b\u00f9 tim r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IaOlde5Rko8LqixUr9klY66lgKb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>G\u1ee3i \u00fd:<\/strong> K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p t\u0103ng tim v\u1edbi n\u1ed9i dung ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u00e0 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c th\u1eadt \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea1t hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 l\u00e2u d\u00e0i.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S0uOdqqK2oNn01xY0A1lwdsKgbh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-N5rudWJxqoMactxoXpxlRvytgTf\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>5. Nh\u1eefng trang web t\u0103ng tim TikTok uy t\u00edn, ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M4EwdlR7uozLsFxtqVplfK9kgNg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">D\u1ef1a tr\u00ean c\u00e1c ti\u00eau ch\u00ed \u0111\u00e3 n\u00eau v\u1ec1 vi\u1ec7c ch\u1ecdn website t\u0103ng tim TikTok uy t\u00edn (nh\u01b0 \u0111\u1ed9 minh b\u1ea1ch, tim ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng, an to\u00e0n, h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p). Danh s\u00e1ch d\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 trang web uy t\u00edn v\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ed5ng h\u1ee3p t\u1eeb th\u00f4ng tin tr\u00ean web v\u00e0 c\u00e1c ngu\u1ed3n \u0111\u00e1ng tin c\u1eady. C\u00e1c website n\u00e0y \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 cao v\u1ec1 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4911\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4911\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4911\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/7-2.png\" alt=\"Kh\u00f4ng n\u00ean nh\u1eadp m\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u TikTok ho\u1eb7c th\u00f4ng tin c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n v\u00e0o b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 website n\u00e0o\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/7-2.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/7-2-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/7-2-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/7-2-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/7-2-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4911\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Kh\u00f4ng n\u00ean nh\u1eadp m\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u TikTok ho\u1eb7c th\u00f4ng tin c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n v\u00e0o b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 website n\u00e0o<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"LG9gdOcfloGROUxiGtRlDwbzgya\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-Mu9xdOv95oxT2vxUemplPpJwgdc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"sheet\">\n<table style=\"width: 95.2251%;\">\n<colgroup>\n<col width=\"129\" \/>\n<col width=\"164\" \/>\n<col width=\"126\" \/>\n<col width=\"128\" \/>\n<col width=\"160\" \/>\n<col width=\"171\" \/><\/colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 14.4766%;\"><strong>Website<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 18.3742%;\"><strong>Gi\u00e1 c\u1ea3 (VN\u0110)<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 17.0218%;\"><strong>Ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng tim<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 11.486%;\"><strong>B\u1ea3o h\u00e0nh<\/strong>